# Cloudflare Pages redirects. One rule per line: from, to, status.
#
# Rebuilt 27 Aug 2026 from Wix's own redirect manager export, which is the
# source that was missing the first time. The original eight rules came from
# diffing the live sitemaps against this repo, and a Wix sitemap lists neither
# noindexed pages nor pages that are already redirects, so eighteen rules were
# invisible to that method. Ten of them still take Google impressions: 3,564
# impressions and 23 clicks over the sixteen months to 26 Aug 2026, measured
# against the sc-domain property rather than estimated.
#
# Every destination was checked to exist in this repo, and every source was
# checked against Search Console. Where Wix and this file disagreed about a
# destination, Wix wins: Google has consolidated those URLs onto the Wix target
# for years, and moving the target restarts that for no gain.
#
# Rules match top to bottom, so the more specific path goes first.

# ── The nested Wix page, which has to precede its own parent ──────────────
# The line array URL under rent-sound-equipment served the general sound
# equipment page's content at a slug promising line arrays. Whatever it ranks
# for is a line array query, so it goes to the dedicated page rather than to
# the page it was duplicating.
/rent-sound-equipment/line-array-speaker-rental-dallas-fort-worth  /rent-line-array-speaker-system  301

# ── Wix pages that no longer exist ────────────────────────────────────────
# Not in the redirect export, because on Wix this is a real page rather than a
# rule. Its content lives on the destination.
/photography-videography             /services-photo-and-video      301

