# ── David's Bridal Frisco ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# On Wix the page lives at /davids-bridal-frisco and /davidsbridalfrisco is a
# rule pointing at it with the campaign UTMs appended. Here the page itself is
# at /davidsbridalfrisco, which is the short form the printed QR encodes, so
# the arrow turns around. The UTMs are not needed: the page stamps the campaign
# into GA4 from its own head block, because the QR never carried one.
/davids-bridal-frisco                /davidsbridalfrisco            301
/david-s-bridal-firsco               /davidsbridalfrisco            301
/blank                               /davidsbridalfrisco            301

# ── Wix system URLs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Wix's built-in site search, which a static site has no equivalent for, and
# its duplicate of the homepage.
/search                              /                              301
/search-results                      /                              301
/home                                /                              301
/blog/page/*                         /blog                          301
